@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

@* @layout stays: the NotFoundPage render path may not apply the router's DefaultLayout, and without it an
   unknown URL would render with no main, no nav and no skip link. *@
<PageTitle>Page not found - Film and TV library</PageTitle>

@* tabindex="-1": see the note in Movies.razor. FocusOnNavigate adds it at runtime, ElementReference
   .FocusAsync() does not and fails silently without it, so the heading declares it itself. *@
<h1 tabindex="-1">Page not found</h1>

<p>Sorry, nothing lives at this address. <a href="movies">Back to the library</a>.</p>
